sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Hermes A / Alice
    participant BZ as Buzz channel
    participant B as Hermes B / Bob
    participant W as WavelengthAdapter
    participant D as Wavelength daemon

    A->>BZ: kind 9 PaymentIntent
    BZ->>B: signed event
    B->>B: validate as untrusted
    B->>BZ: kind 9 PaymentQuote
    BZ->>A: signed event
    A->>W: prepare(receive_instruction)
    W->>D: raw PrepareSend
    D-->>W: exact send_intent_id + preview
    W-->>A: prepared payload + hash
    A->>A: local human approval
    A->>W: execute(exact prepared payload)
    W->>D: raw Send(send_intent_id)
    D-->>W: COMPLETE + settlement reference
    B->>D: activity --kind recv
    D-->>B: matching incoming activity
    B->>BZ: kind 9 PaymentReceipt
    BZ->>A: signed receipt
